{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國布法羅大學團隊利用第一性原理計算，預測六方氮化硼中不同原子缺陷遇到激光時會產生怎樣的光學「指紋」。研究分析了十類缺陷，包括硼或氮原子空位，以及碳原子取代硼、氮位置形成的缺陷結構，發現它們會改變材料產生的光信號強度與偏振特徵。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585884.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:33:41.262987+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:07:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:27:05.639243+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:27:05.639243+00:00","content_hash":"90f7bac91cfa7d375b41ed2dbf515f1e84d063530f9d56ff647a9686ca911f46","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}